## Many Code Blocks

```php
<?php
function test1() { return 1; }
```

```javascript
function test2() { return 2; }
```

```python
def test3(): return 3
```

```rust
fn test4() -> i32 { 4 }
```

```go
func test5() int { return 5 }
```

```java
public int test6() { return 6; }
```

```csharp
public int Test7() { return 7; }
```

```ruby
def test8() 8 end
```

```swift
func test9() -> Int { return 9 }
```

```kotlin
fun test10() = 10
```

